Package: md-viewer-plain
Version: 2.2.0-4
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0
Maintainer: Local Build <local@localhost>
Description: Lightweight Markdown viewer and editor with a plain theme
 A Linux adaptation of MD Viewer 2.2.0 with a generic interface,
 Markdown preview and editing, theme switching, local images, file watching,
 and DOCX export.
